      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Strolling through the evening streets after the movie, Elena confesses that she nearly cried at the ending of the film. When Viktor Petrovich jokes that head chefs are too tough to cry, Elena reminds him that she is a woman first and asks how his restaurant got its name.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
